## Dataset Description

The `data/` directory contains original datasets used for downstream analyses:

- `meta_intensity_pos.xlsx`  
  Metabolomics data acquired in positive ion mode. Rows represent metabolites and columns represent samples. Values correspond to processed intensity measurements.

- `meta_intensity_neg.xlsx`  
  Metabolomics data acquired in negative ion mode with the same structure as above.

- `Proteome.xlsx`  
  Processed proteomics data. Rows represent proteins (gene symbols or protein IDs), and columns represent samples. Values correspond to normalized protein abundance.

- `Transcriptome.xlsx`  
  Transcriptomic count data. Rows represent genes and columns represent samples. Raw counts were used for downstream analysis.
